      "options": {
        "content": "**Not classic RED.** There is no `http_requests_total` or app latency histogram. Used live series only: Loki error rate, `up` (availability), `scrape_duration_seconds` (scrape latency, often ~8s timeout), GPU util/VRAM (saturation). node_exporter `node_load1` exists unlabeled and is omitted here so taxonomy filters stay honest. 3090 LocalAI stay loaded; Comfy masked.",
